            "english_quote": "in the argument under examination",
            "issue": "This alternative in the lexical note reverses the adjective's direction: ἐξεταστικός characterizes discourse that examines or tests, not discourse that is itself undergoing examination. The main rendering “in the critical argument” is defensible in the examining or analytical sense, but this stated alternative is not adequately supported.",
